                              ▼
                    provenance-aware service
                         /          \
                        /            \
                     PBD              LIVE
                      │                │
                      ▼                ▼
                 historical       real market activity
                    UI                 UI
                      \                /
                       \              /
                        └──────┬─────┘
                               ▼
                         polished detail
```

Use a first-class contract:

```ts
type DataProvenance = 'bootstrap' | 'live';
```

For persisted PBD records:

```text
provenance = bootstrap
bootstrapVersion = v1
```

For live records:

```text
provenance = live
```

If the existing schema already has a compatible field, reuse it rather than creating competing concepts.

