# 11. R7 — Property detail UX (highest priority)

The screen should feel mature without becoming information-dense.

Recommended order:

```text
Property identity / destination
        ↓
Current share price + current state
        ↓
1Y price chart (only when UX eligibility = secondary/resale)
        ↓
PBD! — mean: Platform bootstrap data
        ↓
Historical high / low / change / range
        ↓
