# 15. Data transition after launch

The intended lifecycle is:

```text
                    LAUNCH
                       │
         ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
         ▼                           ▼
    PBD history                  LIVE activity
    immutable context            actual events
         │                           │
         └──────────────┬────────────┘
                        ▼
                 provenance-aware UI
```

PBD is historical context. It should become increasingly less prominent as live activity accumulates, but it must never be rewritten to make the chart appear continuous.

When the first live event occurs:

- store the actual event timestamp;
- do not backfill invented events;
- append live history after the cutoff;
- preserve PBD version;
- keep PBD disclosure adjacent to PBD content.

