## R4 — Generator
**Stop condition:** deterministic 52-ish point history, bounded and continuous at cutoff.

## R5 — House-book reconciliation
**Stop condition:** Option A selected by default; financial path untouched unless explicitly authorized; public/auth Recent Trades server-side live-only.

## R6 — API/service
**Stop condition:** provenance-aware contract, bounded queries, no N+1, public/auth parity.

## R7 — UX
**Stop condition:** existing chart wired, PBD visible, status eligibility respected, Telegram viewport clean.

## R8 — Recent Trades
**Stop condition:** only live activity under canonical Recent Trades everywhere.

## R9 — Order book
**Stop condition:** no bootstrap data can become executable liquidity.

## R10 — Verification
**Stop condition:** actual test results recorded; unavailable runtime marked BLOCKED.

**Agent instruction:** after each gate, stop and verify before proceeding. If a gate fails, fix only that gate. Do not continue by assuming the failure is harmless.

