# 19. Product success criterion

Success is not measured by the number of seeded rows.

Success means:

> A new investor opening a resale property immediately sees a coherent one-year historical market context, understands exactly which data is platform bootstrap data, can distinguish it from real live activity, and can use the actual secondary-market actions without the bootstrap layer contaminating financial state.

That is the highest-value combination of **launch credibility, UX quality, performance, and data integrity** for this feature.
